## 4. Verification & Continuous Compliance Rule

Every future phase that touches the respective components above must:
1. Re-verify the corresponding test debt item.
2. Ensure new assertions use explicit `(assert cond msg)` forms.
3. Keep the monorepo test assertion floor strictly non-decreasing (currently $\\ge 418$ non-vacuous assertions across 161 suites).
4. Run `asl test --strict-falsify <test-path>` and `asl gate` before committing.
